    "Name": "Rikki Tikki Tavi",
    "Details": "The Rikki Tikki Tavi 3 is a missile boat variant of the Rikki Tikki Tavi, combining LRM-20 launchers with advanced Artemis IV fire control system attachments. A single Large Pulse Laser and two Extended Range Medium Lasers are mounted for extra damage as needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Distracting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.24</color></b>",
